                help: Some(
                    "**Why:** Components have their own rendering logic. `v-text`/`v-html` would overwrite the component's content unexpectedly.\n\n**Fix:** Pass content via props or slots:\n```vue\n<!-- Instead of -->\n<MyComponent v-html=\"content\" />\n\n<!-- Use slots -->\n<MyComponent><div v-html=\"content\" /></MyComponent>\n```",
